(R,S,R,S,R,S,R)-and (R,S,R,R,R,S,R)-10 (R,S,R,R,R,S,R)-10; 93% yield;
yellow solid. mp. >300 °C; [α]D20= -195 (CHCl3, c 0.10); IR (KBr pellet
method) 2902, 1507, 1385, 1094, 985 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 5.40
(s, 4H), 5.8-5.95 (m, 7H), 5.95-6.1 (m, 7H), 7.2-7.9 (m, H), 7.95 (d, J =
8.1 Hz, 2H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 70.7, 103.5, 103.6, 103.9, 104.1,
110.2, 124.2, 125.5, 125.5, 125.6, 125.7, 125.9, 126.8, 127.1, 127.4,
127.4, 127.5, 127.8, 127.8, 127.9, 128.1, 128.4, 128.6, 128.7, 128.8,
129.0, 129.1, 126.7, 129.8, 130.1, 130.3, 132.3, 136.6, 143.0, 144.2,
144.5, 144.7, 144.9, 144.9, 150.1. (Some peaks overlapped); HRMS (ESI+)
Calcd for C101H62O16 (M+ H)+: 1631.4116. Found: 1531.4139; LR MS (FAB+)
1531.9 (M+ H)+.
